  "description": "<p><strong>Brand introduction:</strong> Constructive Playthings, established in 1953, is a leading provider of educational toys and supplies.<sup data-turn-source-index=\"1\" _ngcontent-ng-c536726779=\"\"><!----></sup> We're dedicated to fostering early childhood development through high-quality, engaging products.<sup data-turn-source-index=\"2\" _ngcontent-ng-c536726779=\"\"><!----></sup> We're recognized and trusted by teachers, daycares, therapists, churches, and parents nationwide.</p>\r\n<p data-sourcepos=\"3:5-3:476\"><strong>Product description:</strong> Constructive Playthings offers a wide range of educational products and resources designed to inspire learning, creativity, and fun for young children. Our catalog includes everything from early learning manipulatives and arts &amp; crafts supplies to playground equipment!</p>\r\n<p data-sourcepos=\"3:5-3:476\"><strong>Unique Selling Point:&nbsp;&nbsp;</strong>Constructive Playthings' unique selling point lies in our long-standing commitment to quality and educational value. For over 70 years, we've provided products that are not only fun and engaging but also contribute to a child's development. Our focus on teacher-approved resources and excellent customer service truly sets us apart.</p>\r\n<p data-sourcepos=\"3:5-3:476\"><strong>Payment Terms:&nbsp;</strong>Constructive Playthings utilizes the UpPromote Affilate Program. Affiliates earn 5% commision on all qualifying sales. Tracking is facilitated through a 30-day pixel.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p data-sourcepos=\"3:5-3:476\"></p>\r\n<div jslog=\"220997;BardVeMetadataKey:[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[1,null,1]]\" _ngcontent-ng-c2554324755=\"\"><!---->\r\n<div _ngcontent-ng-c2554324755=\"\">\r\n<div _ngcontent-ng-c2554324755=\"\">\r\n<div data-test-id=\"sources-carousel-source\" _ngcontent-ng-c2554324755=\"\"><!----></div>\r\n<!----><!----></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<!----></div>\r\n<p><sources-carousel-inline _nghost-ng-c2657126811=\"\" ng-version=\"0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER\"><sources-carousel _nghost-ng-c2554324755=\"\" id=\"sources\" hide-from-message-actions=\"\" _ngcontent-ng-c2657126811=\"\"><!----></sources-carousel><!----><!----></sources-carousel-inline></p>",
